              "originalWidth": 3900,
              "originalHeight": 3075,
              "caption": "This photo, provided by The Strong Museum in Rochester, N.Y., shows \"Defender\", \"GoldenEye 007\", \"Quake\", and \"Tamagotchi\", the newest inductees into the World Video Game Hall of Fame. (The Strong Museum via AP)",
              "resolutions": [
                {
                  "url": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/cd_VoTnZ28PJhwa2qmI1Og--~B/aD0zMDc1O3c9MzkwMDthcHBpZD15dGFjaHlvbg--/https://media.zenfs.com/en/ap_finance_articles_694/461920a372cb8402557d98b96cfd4a02",
